{"title":"2007 Seniors Pancyprian","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2007 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Seniors_Pancyprian_Competition\" title=\"Seniors Pancyprian Competition\">Seniors Pancyprian Competition</a></b> problems and solutions. There are different papers according to the grade. Click on each one one to find the problems and solution of each paper.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Seniors_Pancyprian/1st_grade&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2007 Seniors Pancyprian/1st grade (page does not exist)\">1st grade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Seniors_Pancyprian/2nd_grade&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2007 Seniors Pancyprian/2nd grade (page does not exist)\">2nd grade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Seniors_Pancyprian/3rd_grade&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2007 Seniors Pancyprian/3rd grade (page does not exist)\">3rd grade</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Seniors_Pancyprian\" title=\"2006 Seniors Pancyprian\">Previous competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial Problems and Solutions\">Back to the List</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Seniors_Pancyprian&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Seniors_Pancyprian_Competition\" title=\"Seniors Pancyprian Competition\">Seniors Pancyprian Competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Seniors_Pancyprian_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Seniors Pancyprian Problems and Solut